"}, {"file_name": "SS5.png", "id": "1110555070708816", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031605_1110555074042149_5355556494513575113_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fOta7AsUWg0Q7kNvwHa2LU2&_nc_oc=Ado4hT9Awmkx8xp6fJLRFAWWsAfv9-tWi7rLmEARD2RvIQhb9wyAHkb_u070Uyo0jl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af53SEqdxPnvSJb6tdo1jdQTEoJuX3IWI9U8SoYefnEZtw&oe=6A11A5F9"}, {"file_name": "SS3.png", "id": "2232942390413795", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86601735_2232942393747128_6918784934605283945_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Dlo0Vuqwa4Q7kNvwEeIZgJ&_nc_oc=Adp_rk1OhpRX2ReT3N0HoWY7bPMEqhjFhXD9OEoLTpi692WQH99DCF_KUOv5qZ4VbxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ZPe2K0ViWs16neyTtlI8FxufDfD1RzQotmzAOS_9gwg&oe=6A11AA69"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Project Coreward", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Welcome to another galaxy. Project Coreward is an open world role playing adventure.\n\nUpgrade your ship. Assemble and train its crew. **Their mission?** To survive, explore and eventually uncover the ancient choices that now weigh darkly on the fate of every world.\n\nProject Coreward features an extensive galaxy created for VR. Guide your ship through the stars in 3rd person and explore large scale solar systems and vast, walk-able planets in first person. Recruit and exchange crew members, engage in diplomacy and combat, and upgrade your skills and your vessel to survive. Most of all, **confront the unknown to reveal the true, vast nature of choice and consequence in a rich storyline**", "short_description": "Embark on an open world journey across the stars while encountering foes, friends and forgotten stories. Build your ship. Recruit and train your crew. Most of all, explore and confront the unknown to reveal the true, vast nature of choice and consequence."}]}, "developer_name"